# Superbrain Tor SOCKS proxy
# Provides private outbound access to the p2pool.observer .onion mirrors so the
# dashboard can sync payouts and shares without leaking the Umbrel's public IP.
SocksPort 0.0.0.0:9050
SocksPolicy accept 10.99.99.0/24
SocksPolicy reject *
Log notice stderr
DataDirectory /tmp/tor
